        \begin{itemize}[leftmargin=1.2em, itemsep=2pt, topsep=3pt]
            \item Comprehensive theoretical and practical guide for all 11 Units of the LPU CSE105 syllabus.
            \item UNIX design principles, kernel-space vs user-space, system calls, and multi-platform installation (Ubuntu, Dual Boot, VMs, WSL 2).
            \item System utilities grammar, time/calendar systems, arithmetic calculation engines, and man-page navigation.
            \item Filesystem Hierarchy Standard (FHS), inode architecture, file operations, permission octal math, and special bits (SUID, SGID, Sticky bit).
